# IMMZ All Decisions — DEPRECATED
library "IMMZ All Decisions (Deprecated)".

/*
DEPRECATED — this file is no longer maintained as a CRL example.

This decision set was originally produced by the FSH → CRL transformer
(`features/cql-pattern-mining/regression-transformer.*`). That tool is
deprecated: its output does not parse under the v2.1.0 grammar and the
transformer itself is not on the roadmap.

For the canonical CDS-style decision example (CMS69 BMI screening), see:
    features/cql-pattern-mining/results/models/cms69-split/clinical-reasoning-language-example.crl

For the source FSH project this file was generated from, see:
    packages/crl/examples/fsh/smart-example-immz/

For the original (pre-deprecation) content of this file, see git history
at any commit before this deprecation banner — `git log --follow` on
this path will surface it.

Kept as a stub so build tools that enumerate `*.crl` files don't break,
and so the directory remains a discoverable pointer to the FSH source.
*/
